"t": "For anyone who wants to put God first",
"s": "The first of your time, money, and body",
"md": "**（Open this page any time.）**\n\n---\n\nDo you know the hardest thing Jesus ever said to a church?\n\n**[Bible · Revelation 2:2-4](https://www.bible.com/bible/59/REV.2.2-4.ESV)**\n\n**\"But I have this against you, that you have abandoned the love you had at first.\"**\n\nHe wasn't attacking their performance. They were busy. They were working well.\n\nBut the first seat was empty.\n\n---\n\n**This guide has been about closeness the whole way through.**\n\nAnd whether closeness is real comes down to one thing.\n\n**Whether he's first.**\n\nYou can't be close to your second most important person. If he isn't first, it isn't closeness.\n\n---\n\n**And \"first\" can't be proven with words.**\n\nThere are only three things we actually have.\n\n**Time. Money. Body.**\n\nHow we use those three says what's first.\n\nAnd the Bible says the same thing about all three.\n\n**Give the first of it.**\n\nNot what's left. What's first.\n\nGiving what's left means \"I'll treasure this if I have margin.\"\nGiving what's first means **\"I treasure this before anything else.\"**\n\n**Firstfruits is about order.**\n\n---\n\n## The first of your time\n\n**Start the day with God.**\n\n**[Bible · Mark 1:35](https://www.bible.com/bible/59/MRK.1.35.ESV)**\n\nJesus prayed early, while it was still dark, alone. The busiest man in the world did that.\n\nIt isn't about length. It's about order.\n\nFive minutes, ten minutes. Open God before you open your phone.\n\n---\n\n## The first of your money\n\n**Give the first tenth of your income to your church.**\n\n**[Bible · Proverbs 3:9](https://www.bible.com/bible/59/PRO.3.9.ESV)**\n\n**Honor the Lord with your wealth and with the firstfruits of all your produce.**\n\nNot out of what's left. Separate it the moment it arrives.\n\nThis is frightening. You don't know if the month will work.\n\nBut it's only inside that fear that you find out whether you actually trust him.\n\n---\n\n## The first of your body\n\n**Keep your body pure, for the bridegroom.**\n\n**[Bible · 1 Corinthians 6:19-20](https://www.bible.com/bible/59/1CO.6.19-20.ESV)**\n\n**You are not your own, for you were bought with a price.**\n\nYour body isn't yours anymore. It's been bought back.\n\nLet go of sex outside marriage. Choose what goes into your eyes. Don't hand the first seat in your heart to anything else.\n\nThis isn't done in order to be loved. You're already loved, so you get ready for him.\n\n---\n\n**All three of these hurt.**\n\nGive up time, and you have less time for other things.\nGive up money, and you have less money to use.\nGuard your body, and there are things you let go of.\n\n**If it doesn't cost anything, it isn't a decision.**\n\nDavid said: **\"I will not offer burnt offerings to the Lord my God that cost me nothing.\"**\n\n**He refused to give an offering he hadn't paid for.**\n\n---\n\n**But don't get the order backwards.**\n\nThis isn't done in order to be loved by God. The love is already paid for.\n\n**You received, so you give.**\n\nYou do lose things. And you gain far more than what you lose.\n\n**Giving the first isn't paying a price. It's settling who comes first.**\n\n---\n\n**And this isn't for people who can do it perfectly.**\n\nYou'll decide, and there'll be days you don't keep it. When that happens, come back.\n\nThat's what this guide has been saying all along. The Father runs to you. The curtain is open.\n\n**A decision isn't a promise never to fail. It's setting a direction.**\n\n---\n\n## If you're deciding\n\nIf you're deciding today, say it out loud.\n\n> \"God, I want you first.\n> I'll start the day with you.\n> I'll give you the first of what comes in.\n> This body is yours, so I'll get it ready for you.\n> I'm scared, and I'm giving it. I trust you.\"\n\n---\n\n**And don't decide alone.**\n\nOnce you've decided, tell a leader, or your brothers and sisters at church.\n\n**A decision made alone wobbles. A decision someone else heard tends to hold.**\n\n---\n\n**【One line for today】**\n\nWhat I decided today.\n＿＿＿＿＿＿"
